== Trivia ==
* This item might be a reference to [[wikipedia:Cutaneous horn|Cutaneous horns]], unusual keratinous skin tumors with the appearance of horns.
* Little Horn was originally an unofficial item which was supposed to showcase the modding capabilities of Afterbirth+ in the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FRR-wzTky9Q PAX 2016 livestream]. However, all items included in the demo were later added to the final game.
* {{dlc|r}} Little Horn's description is a reference to George Orwell's novel ''Nineteen Eighty-Four''.
** This may imply that the boss {{E|Little Horn}} is the younger brother of {{E|Big Horn}}.
* Little Horn is a reference to the Antichrist in the book of Daniel.

